* -m2: ext(pc) with a 16-bit and ext(pc,Xn) with an 8-bit displacement, as both Microware
* assemblers make them, not gas's 68020 forms for a distance not known in its first pass.
* fixed: 4283498 2026-10-10 r68togas, rof2elf, m68k-os9-r68, os9link: corpus fixes; l68's PC-relative error
* options: -m2
* expect text: 45fa0000 123b0000
* expect reloc: R_68K_PC16        ext
* expect reloc: R_68K_PC8         ext+0x00000001
 psect pc_m2,0,0,0,0,0
 lea ext(pc),a2
 move.b ext(pc,d0.w),d1
 ends
